# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
Feature: Memory, export and forget
  Chats and tool results are kept per site in this browser only, when Memory is on. The person
  can export a chat, clear memory, and forget a site.

  # test: test/adapters/indexeddb-memory.test.ts
  @unit
  Scenario: Memory keeps the chat and the tool counts of each site, across restarts
    Given Memory is on
    When a question is answered on a site and the browser restarts
    Then the chat and the counts of that site are still there
    And no other site sees them

  # test: test/adapters/no-memory.test.ts
  @unit
  Scenario: With Memory off nothing is kept
    Given Memory is off
    When a question is answered
    Then nothing is stored

  @smoke
  Scenario: Clear memory in Options says so
    Given WebAIAssist is installed
    And the Options page is open
    When I press "Clear memory"
    Then the options status says "Memory cleared."

  @smoke
  Scenario: Export with nothing to export says so
    Given WebAIAssist is installed
    And a page with two WebMCP tools is open
    And the side panel is open on that page
    When I press "Export"
    Then the page note says "There is nothing to export yet."

  # req: LLM02-2, EU-2
  @smoke
  Scenario: Export writes the chat as a Markdown file with site, time and model
    Given WebAIAssist is installed
    And a page without WebMCP tools is open
    And the side panel is open on that page
    And the scripted model is ready
    When I ask "Hello"
    Then the conversation shows "Scripted reply to: Hello"
    When I press "Export" and save the file
    Then the file is named "webaiassist-conversation.md"
    And the file contains "Scripted reply to: Hello"
    And the file contains "{origin}"

  # test: test/security/adversarial-export.test.ts, test/ui/panel-privacy.test.ts
  # req: LLM02-2
  @unit
  Scenario: Export leaves out the endpoint key and values of secret-looking arguments
    Given an endpoint key and a tool call with a password argument
    Then neither appears in the exported file

  # test: test/core/export.test.ts
  # req: LLM05-1
  @unit
  Scenario: Export cannot be steered: links, images and HTML in answers are escaped
    Given an answer with a Markdown image and an HTML tag
    Then the file shows them as text

  # req: EU-2
  # test: test/core/export.test.ts
  @unit
  Scenario: The exported file says it was written by a local AI model
    Given an exported chat
    Then its header says "Generated by a local AI model through WebAIAssist"

  # req: ASI06-1, LLM01-5
  # test: test/core/agent-loop-saved.test.ts
  @unit
  Scenario: Saved tool results are fenced as untrusted when they come back into a prompt
    Given a saved chat with a tool result that carries instructions
    When the site is opened again and a question is asked
    Then the saved result reaches the model fenced as untrusted data

  @smoke
  Scenario: Going back to a site shows its saved chat again, with Memory on
    Given Memory is on and a chat was held on site A
    When I switch to site B and back to site A
    Then the chat of site A is shown

  @smoke
  Scenario: With Memory off, the empty chat says that chats are not kept
    Given Memory is off
    When I switch to another site
    Then the chat shows "Memory is off, so chats are not kept when you switch sites."

  @smoke
  Scenario: Another site during an answer stops it, and a note says why
    Given an answer is running
    When the tab moves to another site
    Then the answer stops with "Stopped: you switched to {host}."

  @smoke
  Scenario: Another page of the same site does not stop the answer
    Given an answer is running
    When the tab moves to another page of the same site
    Then the answer continues
    And a note "Page changed to" is added when it ends
